ct is highly context-dependent. The core multi-regime logic is preserved but enhanced with cleaner state management and stricter thresholds (RSI < 30) for mean-reversion trades in ranging markets. This evolution focuses on improving entry timing and reducing whipsaw trades, directly addressing common failure modes from past analyses.	79241abf-aefd-4cd5-bc0a-1a2d2eee6797	2026-06-01 20:42:34.217159-04
